      "source": [
        "# range\n",
        "\n",
        "`range` represents an immutable arithmetic progression of integers without storing every element. Its stop value is excluded and its step must be nonzero.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "id": "b28dabf90b73c010",
      "metadata": {
      },
      "source": [
